                "editor": "\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, #162018 0%, #1a1a1a 100%); border: 2px solid #78B74F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 25px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n  <div style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 4px 14px; background: #78B74F; color: #000; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Especialista Certificado</div>\n  <h3 style=\"color: #FFFEF8; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: 700;\">Carlos Alberto Giosa</h3>\n  <p style=\"color: #78B74F; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">Quiromasaje & Masaje Deportivo / Terapéutico</p>\n  <p style=\"color: #abb8c3; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Técnicas avanzadas de descompresión vertebral, recuperación muscular y alivio de dolores crónicos en el espacio de salud de Inguz Box.</p>\n  <div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #78B74F; text-align: left;\">\n    <strong style=\"color: #FFFEF8; font-size: 13px; display: block;\">📍 Gabinete Presencial:</strong>\n    <span style=\"color: #A0A0A0; font-size: 13px;\">Gral. Machado 944, 1° Piso (Morón Centro)</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
